00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:58,520
These, these are fun.

251
00:35:58,520 --> 00:36:00,520
I must admit, these are fun.

252
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:16,520
And the reason I share them is because I think they set up for us what the images that John is going to give us in Chapter 13 and 14 about what the enemy, the red dragon that we talked about last week in Chapter 12, what he is up to in the present reality of the world.

253
00:36:16,520 --> 00:36:28,520
See, last week in Chapter 12, we saw this dragon, this red dragon figure who did everything he could to defeat God all the way up to the point of trying to have him killed.

254
00:36:28,520 --> 00:36:36,520
He thought in his arrogance that if he killed the image, the Son of God, that then he would have victory, jokes on him, resurrection.

255
00:36:36,520 --> 00:36:44,520
And we see in Chapter 12, hopefully you remember the key word, that the dragon was, you guys are so good.

256
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:46,520
God, I've never been more proud.

257
00:36:46,520 --> 00:37:06,520
The dragon was thrown down to the earthly realm, and he's, in a sense, already been defeated, and yet, in another sense, is still flailing and trying to cause as much damage as he possibly can before the consummation of the kingdom of God.

258
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:21,520
And what John is going to say to us in Chapter 13 and 14 is that his last bit strategy, the only thing the dragon can do now, between the ascension of Jesus and the second coming of Jesus, is he can imitate.

259
00:37:21,520 --> 00:37:36,520
Like those bad Halloween costumes, he can try and present himself as something that looks like the kingdom of God, and get you to give your allegiance to something less than the true and real kingdom of God.

260
00:37:36,520 --> 00:37:46,520
If he cannot earn the worship of God, then he will deceive and manipulate us into worshiping something that looks like God, that he is a puppet master behind.

261
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:57,520
Again, just like these costumes imitate the real thing, we're going to see in Revelation 13 and 14 that the dragon's last-ditch effort is to thwart God's plan by imitating him.

262
00:37:57,520 --> 00:38:03,520
And we've all heard the phrase, "Imitation is the highest form of..."

263
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:08,520
By even the strategy that he initiates, he is admitting defeat.

264
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:21,520
And this should encourage us, this should remind us that if this is his strategy, then ultimately we know that the battle has already been lost.

265
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:28,520
My main point this morning that I'm going to keep coming back to and hopefully will frame the way that we think about Chapters 13 and 14 is this:

266
00:38:28,520 --> 00:38:35,520
"The dragon counterfeits God's kingdom to compete for our worship and allegiance."

267
00:38:35,520 --> 00:38:38,520
This is what Chapters 13 and 14 are all about.

268
00:38:38,520 --> 00:38:44,520
Satan will rarely ask us to worship something that looks evil, especially at the beginning.

269
00:38:44,520 --> 00:38:49,520
It might get to a point, the snowball bite rolled down the counterfeit kingdom,

270
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:56,520
where at the end there's things that we're doing that are blatantly evil, but at the beginning he's just imitating things that look like the kingdom of God,

271
00:38:56,520 --> 00:39:00,520
and getting us to give our allegiance and worship to it.

272
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:11,520
And in Chapters 13 and 14 we're going to see three Satan-like figures that are seeking to draw people away from the worship of God.

273
00:39:11,520 --> 00:39:14,520
And really that approach is twofold.

274
00:39:14,520 --> 00:39:17,520
One, he wants to draw people who are already in the church.

275
00:39:17,520 --> 00:39:25,520
Remember, John's writing to seven churches, two of which, two groups of which are either compromising to the culture around them or just in downright rebellion.

276
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:28,520
John's saying this is the strategy of the enemy.

277
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:35,520
He's trying to get those of you who have placed your faith in Jesus to lose sight of the kingdom of God and place your faith and trust in anything other than the kingdom.

278
00:39:35,520 --> 00:39:42,520
And John, even in his seven letters at the beginning of Chapters 2 and 3, he's saying the enemy's having some success with some of you.

279
00:39:42,520 --> 00:39:45,520
You've lost sight of what the true kingdom is.

280
00:39:45,520 --> 00:39:59,520
So he's either trying to draw people from the church out of worship or he's going to manipulate the power structures in the world to persecute the church so that more faithful followers will reject God and worship him instead.

281
00:39:59,520 --> 00:40:00,520
And what's happening throughout the Roman Empire.

282
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:04,520
We see Rome very heavily persecuting the church.

283
00:40:04,520 --> 00:40:07,520
And what John is saying is that the dragon is behind this.

284
00:40:07,520 --> 00:40:09,520
But this is not Rome persecuting the church.

285
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:14,520
This is the dragon at work to persecute the church.

286
00:40:14,520 --> 00:40:21,520
And many scholars refer to these three images as the unholy trinity.

287
00:40:21,520 --> 00:40:29,520
That it's clear that what the dragon is doing is just trying to act as if he is the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit.

288
00:40:29,520 --> 00:40:38,520
But instead of having authority over all of the cosmos, he just has temporary authority over the earthly places that he's been given authority to.

289
00:40:38,520 --> 00:40:42,520
He doesn't have any authority that hasn't been given to him.

290
00:40:42,520 --> 00:40:48,520
The dragon is going to resemble the Father because he functions first and foremost in the heavenly realms before he is.

291
00:40:48,520 --> 00:40:51,520
You guys are awesome.

292
00:40:51,520 --> 00:40:59,520
And then in verse 13, or chapter 13, we're going to see the beast of the sea who's going to function as a counterfeit Jesus and his kingdom.

293
00:40:59,520 --> 00:41:08,520
And then we're going to see the beast of the earth who resembles the Holy Spirit and manifests miraculous things symbolized by both fire and breath.

294
00:41:08,520 --> 00:41:14,520
Thankfully, if you're a student of the Scriptures, you hear fire and you hear breath and you think, Holy Spirit.

295
00:41:14,520 --> 00:41:21,520
And all of this is done for the purpose of stealing our worship and the glory that is due the Creator God.

296
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:27,520
And again, I would say it's a subtle admission that he knows he has been defeated.

297
00:41:27,520 --> 00:41:33,520
So, let's look first at the beast of the sea in chapter 13.

298
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:39,520
So, in chapter 12 ends, the dragon is thrown down and he's standing on the sand of the sea.

299
00:41:39,520 --> 00:41:50,520
And it says, John says, I saw a beast rising out of the sea with ten horns, seven heads and ten crowns on its horns and blasphemous names on its head.

300
00:41:50,520 --> 00:41:57,520
And the beast I saw was like a leopard and its feet were like bears and its mouth was like a lion's mouth.

301
00:41:57,520 --> 00:42:04,520
And to it, the dragon gave his power and his throne and great authority.

302
00:42:04,520 --> 00:42:15,520
One of its heads seemed to have a mortal wound, but its mortal wound was healed and the whole earth marveled as they followed the beast.

303
00:42:15,520 --> 00:42:20,520
So, are you hearing the counterfeit kingdom imagery here?

304
00:42:20,520 --> 00:42:24,520
We'll unpack it more, but just try and pull it out as we're reading.

305
00:42:24,520 --> 00:42:28,520
And they worshiped the dragon for he had given his authority to the beast.

306
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:33,520
And they worshiped the beast saying, who is like the beast and who can fight against it?

307
00:42:33,520 --> 00:42:37,520
And the beast was given a mouth uttering haughty and blasphemous words.

308
00:42:37,520 --> 00:42:44,520
And it was allowed, again, already defeated, allowed to exercise authority for 42 months.

309
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:45,520
This is our three and a half years.

310
00:42:45,520 --> 00:42:48,520
This is just a symbol of temporary.

311
00:42:48,520 --> 00:42:49,520
It's short-lived.

312
00:42:49,520 --> 00:42:50,520
It won't last forever.

313
00:42:50,520 --> 00:42:57,520
It opened its mouth to utter blasphemings against God, blaspheming his name and his dwelling.

314
00:42:57,520 --> 00:42:59,520
That is those who dwell in heaven.

315
00:42:59,520 --> 00:43:03,520
Also, it was allowed to make war on the saints and to conquer them.

316
00:43:03,520 --> 00:43:09,520
And authority was given it over every tribe and people and language and nation.

317
00:43:09,520 --> 00:43:11,520
All who dwell on the earth will worship it.

318
00:43:11,520 --> 00:43:24,520
So we see a beast rising out of the ocean.

319
00:43:24,520 --> 00:43:29,520
And it is a hybrid of a leopard, a bear, and a lion.

320
00:43:29,520 --> 00:43:31,520
And the dragon gives it authority.

321
00:43:31,520 --> 00:43:37,520
And remember, we've talked in the past that almost all of the images found in the book of Revelation are not new.

322
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:40,520
They are recycled from the Old Testament.

323
00:43:40,520 --> 00:43:44,520
And this one is one of the most clear recycled images.

324
00:43:44,520 --> 00:43:53,520
We find this from the book of Daniel, chapter 7, where he talks about where King Nebuchadnezzar gives a vision of a leopard, a bear, and a lion.

325
00:43:53,520 --> 00:44:03,520
And they clearly, in that dream, in that imagery, in the unpacking of that, they clearly refer to worldly empires that will follow Babylon.

326
00:44:03,520 --> 00:44:14,520
Earthly political leaders that will gain power and influence and will promise that if the people of the earth give their allegiance to it, that they will prosper.

327
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:20,520
So, again, hopefully we can see how this is an imitation of what Jesus offers.

328
00:44:20,520 --> 00:44:21,520
Jesus is.

329
00:44:21,520 --> 00:44:35,520
Jesus is, whether we acknowledge it or not, he's a prominent political leader who has come to establish a kingdom that is not just an earthly kingdom, but it is an eternal kingdom.

330
00:44:35,520 --> 00:44:42,520
And he proved that he is the only rightful person to rule by sacrificially offering up his life.

331
00:44:42,520 --> 00:44:48,520
He was conquered so that he could demonstrate his power over death and Hades.

332
00:44:48,520 --> 00:44:56,520
He rose from the dead and he invites anyone who would give their allegiance to his kingdom, both abundant and eternal life.

333
00:44:56,520 --> 00:45:02,520
And those who trust in him will conquer through his act of sacrificial love.

334
00:45:02,520 --> 00:45:07,520
On the other side of the coin, the sea beast is a prominent political leader who is wounded.

335
00:45:07,520 --> 00:45:10,520
He has a mortal wound, but then is healed.

336
00:45:10,520 --> 00:45:11,520
Again, imitation, right?

337
00:45:11,520 --> 00:45:21,520
The enemy is just taking earthly things and trying to make them look as good as the kingdom of God and get us to put our allegiance and our hope and our worship in them.

338
00:45:21,520 --> 00:45:24,520
He conquers through blasphemy and military strength.

339
00:45:24,520 --> 00:45:26,520
He does not invite people to give him worship.

340
00:45:26,520 --> 00:45:30,520
He demands that people worship him or they will be conquered.

341
00:45:30,520 --> 00:45:35,520
Again, imitation is the greatest form of flattery.

342
00:45:35,520 --> 00:45:42,520
John says that in between the inauguration and the consummation of the kingdom of Jesus, earthly leaders will rise.

343
00:45:42,520 --> 00:45:48,520
Earthly governments will rise and they are animated by Satan himself.

344
00:45:48,520 --> 00:45:56,520
And they will offer temporary safety and security for the price of your allegiance.

345
00:45:56,520 --> 00:46:05,520
And I don't think that, I don't think it's a big jump to think that the first century readers would have been thinking about Rome when they read this.

346
00:46:05,520 --> 00:46:09,520
And there's lots of scholars that have lots of different opinions.

347
00:46:09,520 --> 00:46:15,520
The take that I'm going to say is I think it's true about Rome and I think it's true about lots of empires throughout human history.

348
00:46:15,520 --> 00:46:28,520
That the enemy is working through temporary kingdoms to draw you away from allegiance to Jesus and to draw you into allegiance to anything that he can counterfeit to resemble something as good as the kingdom of God.

349
00:46:29,520 --> 00:46:36,520
And in that is going to be this allure because how we conquer, I'm getting ahead of myself, but I'm going to go ahead and do it.

350
00:46:36,520 --> 00:46:42,520
How we conquer in the kingdom of God is by following the way of the land, sacrificially laying down our life.

351
00:46:42,520 --> 00:46:44,520
And I don't know about you, but that's not fun.

352
00:46:44,520 --> 00:46:52,520
And so these counterfeit kingdoms, what they'll do is they'll say you get to join the winning team that has power and control and influence.

353
00:46:52,520 --> 00:47:07,520
You get to be a part of this thing that looks like it's winning and it's a lot easier to give your allegiance to something that looks powerful and awesome and looks like it's winning than it is to give your allegiance to a lamb who is slain.

354
00:47:07,520 --> 00:47:21,520
And these images are coming to get us to realize that the beast is offering you an imitation kingdom that is temporary and will not ultimately lead to your life and flourishing.

355
00:47:24,520 --> 00:47:53,520
So what I'm drawing out for you here is that literally John says any human being who lives on earth from now until the second coming of Jesus,

356
00:47:53,520 --> 00:48:03,520
the second coming of Jesus that does not place their faith, allegiance, and worship in Jesus, they will find themselves worshiping a kingdom that is coming.

357
00:48:03,520 --> 00:48:11,520
And even the, we, again, we could debate about how all of this plays out as this one singular kingdom in the future.

358
00:48:11,520 --> 00:48:12,520
It doesn't matter.

359
00:48:12,520 --> 00:48:20,520
The practical implications are every single human being that does not give their worship and allegiance to Jesus will give it to something else.

360
00:48:20,520 --> 00:48:27,520
And that something else is a kingdom that the enemy of God has counterfeited to draw you away from the worship and allegiance of the one true God.

361
00:48:27,520 --> 00:48:34,520
The dragon counterfeits God's kingdom and its goal is to compete for our worship and allegiance.

362
00:48:34,520 --> 00:48:39,520
So the question then becomes to whom or to what are you giving your allegiance to?

363
00:48:39,520 --> 00:48:42,520
To whom or to what are you worshiping?

364
00:48:42,520 --> 00:48:52,520
And just to get even more practical, because allegiance and worship are these like big 30,000 foot words that really, it would be easy for us to say like, yeah, Jesus has my allegiance.

365
00:48:52,520 --> 00:48:53,520
Yeah, Jesus has my worship.

366
00:48:53,520 --> 00:48:55,520
Let's get really practical.

367
00:48:55,520 --> 00:48:56,520
Let me ask you this.

368
00:48:56,520 --> 00:48:59,520
What excites your imagination?

369
00:48:59,520 --> 00:49:03,520
What fuels your actions on a daily basis?

370
00:49:03,520 --> 00:49:05,520
What do you, let's go back to Deuteronomy 6.

371
00:49:05,520 --> 00:49:09,520
What do you talk about with your children when you get up?

372
00:49:09,520 --> 00:49:11,520
And when you go to bed?

373
00:49:11,520 --> 00:49:13,520
And when you're around the dinner table?

374
00:49:13,520 --> 00:49:16,520
Is it the kingdom of God or is it something else?

375
00:49:16,520 --> 00:49:20,520
And that's going to answer for us really practically this question.

376
00:49:20,520 --> 00:49:25,520
Again, I think it's really easy for Christians to say, yes, God and his kingdom have our ultimate allegiance.

377
00:49:25,520 --> 00:49:27,520
But what do we think about?

378
00:49:27,520 --> 00:49:28,520
And what do we do?

379
00:49:28,520 --> 00:49:31,520
And what do we post on social media?

380
00:49:31,520 --> 00:49:33,520
And what do we put our hopes and our dreams in?

381
00:49:33,520 --> 00:49:34,520
And what are we afraid of?

382
00:49:34,520 --> 00:49:41,520
And what does this reveal about what we actually worship and what we actually place our allegiance in?

383
00:49:41,520 --> 00:49:49,520
Are we giving our lives of sacrificial love to the eternal kingdom defined by the image of a lamb who looks like he's been slain?

384
00:49:49,520 --> 00:49:55,520
Or are we giving our lives to temporary counterfeit kingdoms defined by comfort, success, power, control?

385
00:49:55,520 --> 00:49:57,520
On and on we could go.

386
00:49:57,520 --> 00:50:04,520
And I think these are the questions that John wants the disciples of Jesus in the first century to meditate on.

387
00:50:04,520 --> 00:50:15,520
Because it's so easy for us to just slowly, without realizing it, place our allegiance and our worship in things that are counterfeit to the kingdom of God.

388
00:50:15,520 --> 00:50:20,520
He goes on and describes the second beast that I think imitates the spirit of God in verse 11.

389
00:50:20,520 --> 00:50:24,520
And then I saw another beast rising out of the earth.

390
00:50:24,520 --> 00:50:27,520
It had two horns like a lamb and it spoke like a dragon.

391
00:50:27,520 --> 00:50:41,520
It exercises all of the authority of the first beast in its presence and makes the earth and its inhabitants worship the first beast whose mortal wound was healed.

392
00:50:41,520 --> 00:50:50,520
Again, the Holy Spirit comes in ultimately to empower and gift people and to fuel the church to worship Jesus.

393
00:50:50,520 --> 00:50:52,520
This is what the dragon is doing.

394
00:50:52,520 --> 00:50:59,520
It's trying to use its power to draw attention and worship to the earthly counterfeit kingdoms and empires.

395
00:50:59,520 --> 00:51:03,520
It performs great signs, even making fire come down from heaven to earth in front of people.

396
00:51:03,520 --> 00:51:16,520
And by the signs that it is allowed to work in the presence of the beast, it deceives those who dwell on the earth, telling them to make an image for the beast that was wounded by the sword and yet lived.

397
00:51:16,520 --> 00:51:27,520
It was allowed to give breath to the image of the beast so that the image of the beast might even speak and might cause those who would not worship the image of the beast to be slain.

398
00:51:27,520 --> 00:51:42,520
Also, it causes both small and great, both rich and poor, both free and slave, to be marked on the right hand or the forehead so that no one can buy or sell unless he has the mark that is the name of the beast, the number of its name.

399
00:51:42,520 --> 00:51:44,520
This calls for wisdom.

400
00:51:44,520 --> 00:51:52,520
Let the one who has understanding calculate the number of the beast, where it is the number of a man and his number is 666.

401
00:51:52,520 --> 00:51:58,520
And everybody's been waiting six weeks to get to this point so that I will tell you what the mark of the beast is.

402
00:51:58,520 --> 00:52:08,520
I'm not even going to make a joke because I don't know if you guys will know it's a joke and it's just...

403
00:52:08,520 --> 00:52:09,520
All right.

404
00:52:09,520 --> 00:52:21,520
So the beast of the earth resembles the work of the spirit in the church that it energizes and animates the false gospel and the counterfeit kings and kingdoms with miracles and fire from heaven and breath.

405
00:52:21,520 --> 00:52:23,520
It gives breath to dead idols.

406
00:52:23,520 --> 00:52:31,520
First, it deceives people into giving their allegiance to the counterfeit king and kingdom.

407
00:52:31,520 --> 00:52:45,520
And if it cannot deceive, it will manipulate by the freedom to sell and purchase, safety, security, participation in the earthly kingdom.

408
00:52:45,520 --> 00:52:47,520
The kingdom, it deceives first.

409
00:52:47,520 --> 00:52:55,520
And if it can't deceive you, it will manipulate you to give your allegiance to counterfeit kingdoms created by the beast of the sea.

410
00:52:55,520 --> 00:53:00,520
And again, I think there's some really clear one-to-one connections to the Roman Empire here.

411
00:53:00,520 --> 00:53:17,520
Again, if we're reading this through the lenses of the first century readers, they're going to be thinking a lot about what Rome is doing and how Rome is using the Roman imperial cult, the worship, the religious sacrifices and ceremonial festivities.

412
00:53:17,520 --> 00:53:29,520
The empire of Rome had an entire religious system that was used to deceive people into worshiping Rome and thinking Rome was divine and thinking Rome was going to be the thing that was going to provide them eternal life.

413
00:53:32,520 --> 00:53:38,520
They had an entire religious system built to deceive, and then if deception didn't work, they coerced people.

414
00:53:38,520 --> 00:53:49,520
Christians were being persecuted and being not able to purchase food because they were Christians and because they didn't have allegiance to the Roman Empire.

415
00:53:49,520 --> 00:54:00,520
Again, if it can't deceive you into worshiping with pomp and circumstance, it will coerce you through safety and security, through your hopes, your fears, and your dreams.

416
00:54:00,520 --> 00:54:06,520
The dragon counterfeits God's kingdom to compete for your worship and your allegiance.

417
00:54:06,520 --> 00:54:09,520
And this is what the number of the beast is all about.

418
00:54:09,520 --> 00:54:12,520
It's too long of a rabbit trail for us to go down.

419
00:54:12,520 --> 00:54:14,520
Maybe that's a cop-out, maybe it's not.

420
00:54:14,520 --> 00:54:16,520
We can send you an email, we'll have a conversation.

421
00:54:16,520 --> 00:54:22,520
But it's about getting earthly people to give their allegiance to a counterfeit empire.

422
00:54:22,520 --> 00:54:28,520
It's about starving out anyone who places their allegiance in anything other than the counterfeit empire.

423
00:54:28,520 --> 00:54:35,520
And again, this is why the early Christians were being killed because they refused to give their allegiance to Rome over Jesus.

424
00:54:35,520 --> 00:54:40,520
And this still happens all across the world in countries where Christianity is not legal.

425
00:54:40,520 --> 00:54:49,520
Empires will put pressure on—you will not be able to participate in the system.

426
00:54:49,520 --> 00:54:50,520
You will not be able to buy and sell goods.

427
00:54:50,520 --> 00:54:54,520
If they know you are a Christian, you will not survive in that system.

428
00:54:54,520 --> 00:54:57,520
This happens to this day.

429
00:54:57,520 --> 00:55:01,520
Just like the unholy trinity is seen clearly, I think, in chapters 13 and 14,

430
00:55:01,520 --> 00:55:06,520
the mark of the beast is a clear parody of the Shema that we read in Deuteronomy 6.

431
00:55:06,520 --> 00:55:13,520
In Deuteronomy, Israel is commanded to love the Lord their God with all their heart, soul, mind, and strength,

432
00:55:13,520 --> 00:55:16,520
allegiance, and worship, right?

433
00:55:16,520 --> 00:55:30,520
And it goes on to say that they should bind his words on their hands and their forehead as a symbolic picture of a life in which one's thoughts and actions are totally shaped by covenant loyalty to God.

434
00:55:30,520 --> 00:55:33,520
And then in Revelation, we have the counterfeit kingdom.

435
00:55:33,520 --> 00:55:44,520
The beast is marking his followers in the same two locations, presenting a counterfeit covenant in which allegiance to the beastly kingdom restates both our belief and our behavior.

436
00:55:44,520 --> 00:55:53,520
Scholar G.K. Beal argues that the mark is, therefore, primarily a symbol of spiritual allegiance rather than merely a physical identifier.

437
00:55:53,520 --> 00:55:58,520
And in many cases, the allegiance determines whether or not you have access to fair trade.

438
00:55:58,520 --> 00:56:02,520
This is how the enemy counterfeits and deceives.

439
00:56:02,520 --> 00:56:15,520
And if he cannot deceive faithful followers of Jesus, then he will put their safety and their prosperity at risk to draw them out of worship to the lamb who was slain and into the worship of the beast.

440
00:56:15,520 --> 00:56:19,520
So, okay, I got a clock.

441
00:56:19,520 --> 00:56:24,520
My normal clock is not dead and I was starting to paint, but I see another clock, so we're good.

442
00:56:24,520 --> 00:56:32,520
So, if the early readers were thinking about Rome, does that mean we should be thinking about America?

443
00:56:36,520 --> 00:56:38,520
Don't worry, don't worry, don't worry, don't worry, don't worry.

444
00:56:38,520 --> 00:56:39,520
Don't worry.

445
00:56:39,520 --> 00:56:40,520
That was an awkward pause on purpose.

446
00:56:40,520 --> 00:56:42,520
Don't worry, it's fine.

447
00:56:42,520 --> 00:56:48,520
My answer to that would be maybe some of us.

448
00:56:48,520 --> 00:56:55,520
Because the counterfeit spirit will deceive and coerce us into putting our hope and our allegiance in all sorts of counterfeit kingdoms.

449
00:56:55,520 --> 00:57:00,520
And for some of us, that counterfeit kingdom might look like our nation in this current, present moment.

450
00:57:00,520 --> 00:57:10,520
I do think there is a danger for Christians in America to turn our nation into a counterfeit kingdom that they put their hope and allegiance in over the kingdom of God.

451
00:57:10,520 --> 00:57:12,520
I think it impacts the way we view the world.

452
00:57:12,520 --> 00:57:17,520
It impacts the way that we treat our brothers and sisters in Christ who are citizens of other nations.

453
00:57:17,520 --> 00:57:20,520
We end up having more in common.

454
00:57:20,520 --> 00:57:31,520
We end up having more, we invest more time in what our neighbor down the street thinks who isn't a follower of Jesus than our brother and sister in Christ in a different country around the world.

455
00:57:31,520 --> 00:57:40,520
It impacts the way we view people on other sides of the political aisle, the way that we treat them.

456
00:57:40,520 --> 00:57:41,520
It's subtle.

457
00:57:41,520 --> 00:57:42,520
It's deceptive.

458
00:57:42,520 --> 00:57:45,520
And it clothes itself in religious language.

459
00:57:45,520 --> 00:57:52,520
I've literally, I wasn't even going to, I sometimes I go a little heavy on some of the political engagement.

460
00:57:52,520 --> 00:57:54,520
And I know that's a personal conviction for me.

461
00:57:54,520 --> 00:57:59,520
And so I was going to stay away from this a little bit this week out of maturity.

462
00:57:59,520 --> 00:58:20,520
And then literally this week I saw on social media, not posts from any of you, a post from literally a government department in our nation using religious language.

463
00:58:20,520 --> 00:58:35,520
And all I, the only way I could read it is that it was targeted at Christians to get them to leave their values, the Jesus centered values at the door in order to give their allegiance to American exceptionalism instead.

464
00:58:35,520 --> 00:58:40,520
And it steals the worship of otherwise faithful followers of Jesus.

465
00:58:40,520 --> 00:59:00,520
There are some of you in the room that love Jesus, but you spend far more time listening to the news and meditating on the prosperity of our nation than you do spending time in the word and in community with other believers, imagining and meditating on the beauty of the kingdom of God.

466
00:59:00,520 --> 00:59:05,520
And that is a subtle attack from the enemy.

467
00:59:05,520 --> 00:59:07,520
And so it could be for you that.

468
00:59:07,520 --> 00:59:10,520
I'm not saying that it is, but it could be.

469
00:59:10,520 --> 00:59:25,520
But because we live in a democratic republic that places a high value on individual freedom, we live in a world that is ripe for all kinds of counterfeit kingdoms to be created by all kinds of different leaders and by you yourself.

470
00:59:25,520 --> 00:59:44,520
Maybe you've created a, maybe you've created a, maybe the enemy has created a counterfeit kingdom through you that focuses your career, focuses on your career, your entertainment, your, the image of your family, the sports franchise that you put your livelihood and success in and on and on we could go.

471
00:59:44,520 --> 00:59:57,520
The question becomes, if you want to know who is John talking about to you when he gives these images of counterfeit kingdoms, the question you should ask yourself is, what excites my imagination?

472
00:59:57,520 --> 00:59:59,520
And what fuels my action?

473
00:59:59,520 --> 01:00:02,520
What motivates my financial decisions?

474
01:00:02,520 --> 01:00:05,520
Is it the kingdom of God or is it something else?

475
01:00:05,520 --> 01:00:15,520
And the answer to those questions will ultimately help you begin to identify where your worship and allegiance is primarily from.

476
01:00:15,520 --> 01:00:27,520
I think a thought experiment we could do this week is just, just imagine for a moment that you had a, a massive windfall of unexpected tasks coming to your bank account.

477
01:00:27,520 --> 01:00:31,520
What are you thinking about doing with that task?

478
01:00:31,520 --> 01:00:34,520
This is a worship and allegiance question.

479
01:00:34,520 --> 01:00:36,520
And I'm scared to do that for myself.

480
01:00:36,520 --> 01:00:43,520
I will later, not now, because it could get ugly up here.

481
01:00:43,520 --> 01:00:51,520
Because I am, to quote Paul, the chief among sinners, I am not up here proclaiming a message that I had a handle on.

482
01:00:51,520 --> 01:00:57,520
I am preaching to myself because I am drawn away by counterfeit kingdoms day in and day out.

483
01:00:57,520 --> 01:01:04,520
Moment by moment, my imagination is awakened by things that are temporary and draw me away from allegiance to Jesus.

484
01:01:04,520 --> 01:01:09,520
The dragon counterfeits God's kingdom to compete for worship and allegiance.

485
01:01:09,520 --> 01:01:14,520
And imitation is the highest form of flattery and is a mission of defeat.

486
01:01:16,520 --> 01:01:20,520
The king goes on in chapter 14, we're going to skip one through five and come back to them.

487
01:01:20,520 --> 01:01:29,520
Chapter six, or verse six of chapter 14, he says, so that, that's the unholy trinity counterfeiting the kingdom.

488
01:01:29,520 --> 01:01:34,520
And then John is going to give us a vision of three angels declaring three messages.

489
01:01:34,520 --> 01:01:37,520
It's going to wrap all of this up, hopefully.

490
01:01:37,520 --> 01:01:49,520
Then I saw an angel flying directly overhead with an eternal gospel to proclaim to those who dwell on the earth, those who are being deceived by counterfeit kingdoms, to every nation, tribe, language, and people.

491
01:01:50,520 --> 01:02:01,780
An angel said with a loud voice, fear God and give him glory because the hour of his judgment has come and worship him who made the heavens and the earth and the sea and the springs of the water.

492
01:02:01,780 --> 01:02:14,260
An angel comes to the earthly people who are being deceived by the counterfeit kingdoms and proclaims the eternal gospel saying, give your worship and allegiance to the God who created everything, not this Sam who's counterfeiting the one who made everything.

493
01:02:16,260 --> 01:02:22,520
Another angel followed saying, fallen, fallen is Babylon the great.

494
01:02:22,520 --> 01:02:27,100
Babylon is literally just a biblical word that means counterfeit kingdom, right?

495
01:02:27,100 --> 01:02:33,080
It is kingdoms influenced by, it is kingdoms influenced by temporary success and wisdom.

496
01:02:33,080 --> 01:02:35,700
It is the counterfeit kingdom of God in the Scriptures.

497
01:02:35,700 --> 01:02:38,900
So first angel says, God is coming.

498
01:02:38,900 --> 01:02:40,100
He will judge you.

499
01:02:40,100 --> 01:02:43,500
You need to place your worship and allegiance in him.

500
01:02:43,500 --> 01:02:45,780
You need to wake up to what's been happening all around you.

501
01:02:45,820 --> 01:02:51,960
The second says, this thing that you've been placing your faith and trust in, it is falling and it will fall.

502
01:02:51,960 --> 01:03:09,840
And another angel, a third followed, saying with a loud voice, if anyone worships the beast and its image and receives a mark on his forehead or his hands, he will drink the wine of God's wrath, pour it full strength in the cup of his anger, and he will be tormented with fire and sulfur in the presence of the holy angels and in the presence of the Lamb.

503
01:03:11,540 --> 01:03:17,680
And he goes on here, and he goes on here as a call for endurance of the saints who keep the commandments of God and their faith in Jesus.

504
01:03:17,680 --> 01:03:23,340
I heard a voice from heaven saying, write this, blessed are the dead who die in the Lord from now on.

505
01:03:23,340 --> 01:03:30,140
Blessed indeed, says the Spirit, that they may rest from their labors and for their deeds follow them.

506
01:03:31,740 --> 01:03:41,760
So here, John summarizes where all of this is headed, all of this snowballs rolling down the hill, the enemy working behind counterfeit kingdoms to try and draw out your allegiance and your worship.

507
01:03:41,760 --> 01:03:44,440
And it gets heavy and it gets hard to stomach.

508
01:03:44,560 --> 01:03:46,820
But remember, these images are meant to wake us up.

509
01:03:46,820 --> 01:03:48,760
They're meant to get our attention.

510
01:03:48,760 --> 01:03:54,060
This is the love of the Father trying to get your attention to what's actually happening in and around you.

511
01:03:54,060 --> 01:03:58,020
I love how Dr. De Silva puts it.

512
01:03:58,020 --> 01:04:04,980
He says, throughout Revelation, John has been brutally honest about the cost of remaining faithful disciples of the Lamb.

513
01:04:04,980 --> 01:04:12,660
We've read the prayers of the martyrs rising up to the throne room of heaven asking God, how long will we suffer and die?

514
01:04:12,860 --> 01:04:18,740
The book of Revelation has been really intentional to let Christians know that your existence on earth will be hard.

515
01:04:18,740 --> 01:04:28,140
If you keep placing your faith and allegiance in the Lamb who was slain, sometimes you're going to end up looking like the Lamb who was slain because that's what it looks like to worship and give him your allegiance.

516
01:04:28,140 --> 01:04:31,600
But here, he breaks that.

517
01:04:31,600 --> 01:04:39,460
And instead, John understands, it says in Revelation 14, he pays greater attention to the cost of not remaining faithful.

518
01:04:40,760 --> 01:04:47,940
So he's going to the other side of the aisle and saying, those of you that think you're winning because you're on the team of power and success,

519
01:04:47,940 --> 01:04:54,120
like, a day is coming when the wrath of God is going to be poured out.

520
01:04:54,120 --> 01:04:55,860
There is a gospel that is eternal.

521
01:04:55,860 --> 01:04:59,300
And there is a gospel that is temporary.

522
01:04:59,300 --> 01:05:03,520
And fallen, fallen is Babylon the great.

523
01:05:05,520 --> 01:05:09,420
This image is meant to wake up the inhabitants of the earth to repentance.

524
01:05:09,420 --> 01:05:18,260
It's meant to remind those who have been faithful to the Lamb that even though the counterfeit looks like it's winning, it will not last.

525
01:05:18,260 --> 01:05:24,700
Jesus says, in this world you will have trouble, but take heart, I have overcome the world.

526
01:05:24,700 --> 01:05:29,240
This chapter 13 and 14, it's 1 Corinthians 1.

527
01:05:29,240 --> 01:05:34,340
The cross looks foolish to those who are perishing.

528
01:05:34,340 --> 01:05:38,820
But to us who are being saved, it is the power of God to bring salvation.

529
01:05:40,240 --> 01:05:41,600
This is what we've read.

530
01:05:41,600 --> 01:05:46,840
The empires, the counterfeit kingdoms, they will look powerful and in control.

531
01:05:46,840 --> 01:05:51,020
And people will look to those of us who have placed our allegiance in a land that is slain,

532
01:05:51,020 --> 01:05:52,180
and they will say, you fool.

533
01:05:52,180 --> 01:05:55,800
You're wasting all of your time, energy, and resources.

534
01:05:55,800 --> 01:05:57,960
Why don't you come participate in this thing?

535
01:05:57,960 --> 01:06:00,500
Why don't you come invest in this thing?

536
01:06:01,620 --> 01:06:05,320
Why don't you get the second house and the boat and the, you're missing out.

537
01:06:05,320 --> 01:06:14,140
And Paul says, no, the cross might look like foolishness to the residents of the earth,

538
01:06:14,140 --> 01:06:16,120
but that's because their hope is in temporary things.

539
01:06:16,120 --> 01:06:19,000
It's actually the power of God for salvation.

540
01:06:19,000 --> 01:06:22,840
I love this quote from Stephen Patamore.

541
01:06:22,840 --> 01:06:25,180
He says, talking about Christians,

542
01:06:26,580 --> 01:06:29,160
we look in vain for another way through.

543
01:06:29,160 --> 01:06:33,960
For a story which gets us to the sky without the cross.

544
01:06:33,960 --> 01:06:36,420
There is none.

545
01:06:36,420 --> 01:06:41,760
And this is the temptation for all of us

546
01:06:41,760 --> 01:06:45,400
when the success of the earthly counterfeit kingdoms is happening.

547
01:06:45,400 --> 01:06:47,800
I love this Jesus guy.

548
01:06:47,800 --> 01:06:49,040
I love his kingdom.

549
01:06:49,040 --> 01:06:53,440
But is there another way in which I can have my cake and eat it too?

550
01:06:55,200 --> 01:07:00,340
Is there a way in which I can be faithful to Jesus?

551
01:07:00,340 --> 01:07:01,800
I can be a follower of Jesus.

552
01:07:01,800 --> 01:07:05,840
I can get all of the eternal blessings and promises that the Scriptures talk about

553
01:07:05,840 --> 01:07:10,360
and still invest in the counterfeit kingdoms of this earth.

554
01:07:10,360 --> 01:07:12,080
And Stephen Patamore says, there is none.

555
01:07:12,080 --> 01:07:14,820
And the Scripture says, there is none.

556
01:07:14,820 --> 01:07:20,040
Allegiance to the kingdom of God looks like following the way of Jesus,

557
01:07:20,040 --> 01:07:23,040
which gets us to 14 verses 1 through 5.

558
01:07:24,140 --> 01:07:30,880
John says, then I looked and behold, on Mount Zion stood the Lamb and with him 144,000.

559
01:07:30,880 --> 01:07:35,260
Again, this is just this number of complete multitude, a magnitude that cannot be counted.

560
01:07:35,260 --> 01:07:40,560
Who had his name and his father's name written on their foreheads.

561
01:07:40,560 --> 01:07:45,440
And I heard a voice from heaven like the roar of many waters and like the sound of thunder.

562
01:07:45,540 --> 01:07:48,640
The voice I heard was like the sound of a harpist playing on their harps.

563
01:07:48,640 --> 01:07:53,380
And they were singing a new song before the throne and before the living creatures and before the elders.

564
01:07:53,380 --> 01:07:58,840
No one could learn the song except the 144,000 who had been redeemed from the earth.

565
01:07:58,840 --> 01:08:02,820
It is these who have not defiled themselves as women.

566
01:08:02,820 --> 01:08:03,600
So they are virgins.

567
01:08:03,740 --> 01:08:04,960
That's another rabbit trail.

568
01:08:04,960 --> 01:08:06,300
We don't have time to go down.

569
01:08:06,300 --> 01:08:12,640
But listen, it is these who follow the Lamb wherever he goes.

570
01:08:12,640 --> 01:08:19,740
They have been redeemed from mankind as the firstfruits for God and the Lamb.

571
01:08:19,740 --> 01:08:24,380
And in their mouths no lie was found, for they are blameless.

572
01:08:25,480 --> 01:08:34,220
So the question becomes, in between the counterfeit kingdom, the success, and the final judgment, John sees a beautiful image.

573
01:08:34,220 --> 01:08:38,420
Maybe one of my favorite images in the whole book so far.

574
01:08:38,420 --> 01:08:44,700
Of a faithful remnant of people from every tribe, language, nation, and tongue.

575
01:08:44,700 --> 01:08:46,360
This isn't an America thing.

576
01:08:46,360 --> 01:08:47,720
This isn't a Western thing.

577
01:08:47,720 --> 01:08:49,860
This is a whole world thing.

578
01:08:49,860 --> 01:08:59,100
People from every tribe, language, and tongue who have refused the alluring deception and the pressure of the dragon's counterfeit kingdom.

579
01:08:59,100 --> 01:09:07,600
The complete, innumerable number of people from every tribe, language, and tongue not being forced to wear the mark of the beast,

580
01:09:07,600 --> 01:09:13,980
but willfully receiving the name of God on their forehead and hands, joyfully giving him the worship that he is due.

581
01:09:13,980 --> 01:09:18,700
The worship that the dragon is trying to deceitfully steal.

582
01:09:19,700 --> 01:09:23,760
And my assumption is that this is our goal for most of us in the room.

583
01:09:23,760 --> 01:09:33,760
Most of us want to find ourselves in this faithful group of people who remain faithful to the king of kings and Lord of lords, no matter what comes our way.

584
01:09:33,760 --> 01:09:35,840
This is our desire.

585
01:09:35,840 --> 01:09:36,460
This is our heart.

586
01:09:36,460 --> 01:09:37,420
This is why we're here.

587
01:09:37,420 --> 01:09:40,380
And the question becomes, how do we get there?

588
01:09:40,380 --> 01:09:45,600
How do we end up in this multitude from every tribe, language, nation, and tongue?

589
01:09:45,600 --> 01:09:47,380
And the answer is in the text.

590
01:09:48,180 --> 01:09:52,000
They follow the lamb wherever he goes.

591
01:09:52,000 --> 01:09:56,660
This might be my new favorite verse in the whole Bible.

592
01:09:56,660 --> 01:09:59,880
This is the image of 1 Corinthians.

593
01:09:59,880 --> 01:10:08,440
It is foolishness to those who are placing their hope in earthly things, but it is the power of God for salvation.

594
01:10:08,440 --> 01:10:09,600
Listen, this is the Christian life.

595
01:10:09,600 --> 01:10:15,720
This is true discipleship, not just intellectual agreement to a belief system described in a holy book.

596
01:10:15,720 --> 01:10:19,280
And that is a message that pervades America.

597
01:10:20,960 --> 01:10:34,700
It pervades the Bible about, there are good people, kind, loving, our neighbors, who asked Jesus into their heart when they were at vacation Bible school and they were five years old.

598
01:10:34,700 --> 01:10:38,000
And if you asked them, they would say, I'm a Christian.

599
01:10:38,000 --> 01:10:39,960
They would point to the book.

600
01:10:39,960 --> 01:10:41,580
They would say it's good.

601
01:10:42,960 --> 01:10:45,880
But they do not have a personal relationship with Jesus.

602
01:10:45,880 --> 01:10:49,180
Their lives are not defined by following the lamb wherever he goes.

603
01:10:49,180 --> 01:10:50,720
This is a counterfeit kingdom.

604
01:10:50,720 --> 01:10:57,460
The dragon is using to get good, lovely neighbors and friends and coworkers.

605
01:10:57,720 --> 01:11:05,280
I've got intellectual agreement with a belief system described in a book, but because we live in America and there's no persecution, you can get away with that.

606
01:11:05,280 --> 01:11:18,100
And the church becomes convoluted with people who both have their faith and trust in Jesus alone and people who just think the Jesus thing is cool and it's a nice thing to do on Sunday mornings.

607
01:11:26,100 --> 01:11:35,220
The invitation is total surrender and allegiance to a person that we be with, become like, and do as he did.

608
01:11:35,220 --> 01:11:39,480
A person that has captured our imagination and motivates our actions.

609
01:11:39,480 --> 01:11:43,620
A kingdom that brings the experience of heaven down to earth until he returns.

610
01:11:43,620 --> 01:11:49,980
A person that loved you so much that he laid down his life for you.

611
01:11:49,980 --> 01:12:02,660
A person so strong that the dragon thought he had won, they thought he had killed him, and he said, jokes on you, I'm raising from the dead and ascending to my eternal rightful throne.

612
01:12:02,660 --> 01:12:05,840
I might look like a lamb, but I sound like a lion.

613
01:12:05,840 --> 01:12:08,720
I have won and I will win.

614
01:12:08,720 --> 01:12:14,040
This is the one who is inviting us to follow him wherever he goes.

615
01:12:17,040 --> 01:12:21,700
This leads to some reflection questions for us to end with this morning.

616
01:12:21,700 --> 01:12:26,560
And this has been heavy probably for you because it's heavy for me.

617
01:12:26,560 --> 01:12:32,020
I'm preaching with angst because I'm feeling the angst in my own life and in my own heart.

618
01:12:32,860 --> 01:12:40,560
I know how subtly I am attracted to being on the right side of temporary things.

619
01:12:40,560 --> 01:12:50,340
I know how subtly I'm attracted to comfort, to entertainment, to the American dream.

620
01:12:50,340 --> 01:12:56,920
And I'm not saying any of those things are inherently bad, but when they get our allegiance and our worship, they are.

621
01:12:59,660 --> 01:13:01,960
So some questions I'd love for you to meditate on this week.

622
01:13:01,960 --> 01:13:06,920
What counterfeit kingdoms are capturing your attention and motivating your actions?

623
01:13:09,720 --> 01:13:12,420
What do you think about when you lie in bed?

624
01:13:12,420 --> 01:13:17,800
What consumes your conversations throughout the day?

625
01:13:17,800 --> 01:13:27,000
In what way is the dragon successfully deceiving or coercing you to give your allegiance to one of his many counterfeit kingdoms?

626
01:13:28,740 --> 01:13:34,560
What would it look like practically for you to have God's name written on your forehead and your hand?

627
01:13:38,200 --> 01:13:44,880
This is not easy, and it cannot be done in isolation, but it is worth it.

628
01:13:44,880 --> 01:13:48,560
And that is the goal of John's images in Revelation.

629
01:13:48,560 --> 01:13:56,120
He wants us to see the present spiritual realities in light of the present temporary realities.

630
01:13:56,120 --> 01:14:02,920
He wants us to see the future spiritual realities in light of the present realities.

631
01:14:04,580 --> 01:14:12,380
My prayer is that we would be a people who both demonstrate and declare the good news of the eternal kingdom of our Lamb wherever we go.

632
01:14:12,380 --> 01:14:18,920
My prayer is that we would always remember fallen, fallen as devil on the grave.

633
01:14:21,760 --> 01:14:26,180
The entire book of Revelation is crescendoing us to this truth.

634
01:14:26,180 --> 01:14:34,420
The consummation of the Lamb's kingdom is coming, and on that day we will all be judged based on the content of our worship.

635
01:14:34,420 --> 01:14:40,000
The dragon counterfeits God's kingdom to compete for our worship and allegiance,

636
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:44,520
and we conquer him by following the Lamb wherever he goes.

637
01:14:50,860 --> 01:14:51,500
Let's pray.

638
01:14:51,500 --> 01:15:06,720
Holy Spirit, I just pray for every individual in the room today.

639
01:15:06,720 --> 01:15:14,580
I feel as if a lot of this message was motivated towards conviction.

640
01:15:15,380 --> 01:15:18,180
I'm feeling conviction in my own heart and in my own life.

641
01:15:18,180 --> 01:15:27,880
And I pray that as we receive conviction, that we would repent, which means turn.

642
01:15:27,880 --> 01:15:34,840
And when we turn, that we would be reminded of the image that we have of repentance in Luke chapter 15, the prodigal son.

643
01:15:35,020 --> 01:15:42,720
That when we turn, what we do not see is a father shaking his fist at us, but we see a loving father running to us with his arms open.

644
01:15:42,720 --> 01:15:50,020
And so if this message has been heavy on some people, God, I pray that they would experience your grace in this moment.

645
01:15:54,660 --> 01:16:03,800
That the enemy might sneak in and try and talk them out of the conviction that they're feeling, because we live in a world where we don't like to feel things that are uncomfortable.

646
01:16:05,000 --> 01:16:16,820
That may we realize that conviction is a gift from God to invite us to deeper, step-by-step following the Lamb wherever he goes.

647
01:16:19,140 --> 01:16:29,200
And so God, I just pray for these people, I pray for my own heart, I pray that we'd be encouraged by the truths that we read, the images that we're meditating on.

648
01:16:29,200 --> 01:16:38,400
That if we've drifted from worship and allegiance to you, that we just come back with greater joy and excitement and hope.

649
01:16:40,920 --> 01:16:53,620
God, may this church be a church full of people who take seriously that command, that indication to follow Jesus wherever he goes.

650
01:16:53,620 --> 01:16:55,960
It gets messy, it gets confusing.

651
01:16:55,960 --> 01:17:00,000
What would Jesus do is a really cute thing to put on a bracelet.

652
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:05,920
What would Jesus do if he were me in this really messy situation gets a lot harder.

653
01:17:06,240 --> 01:17:14,340
And so provide for us community and wisdom through your Holy Spirit and your Scriptures so that we know what it actually looks like to follow the Lamb wherever he goes.

654
01:17:14,340 --> 01:17:24,560
And God, may we hold our convictions with open hands.

655
01:17:24,560 --> 01:17:30,540
May we not judge people who don't come to the same conclusions as us.

656
01:17:31,760 --> 01:17:40,460
May we be curious and ask questions and grow deeper and deeper into communion with one another and communion with you through the power of the Holy Spirit.

657
01:17:40,460 --> 01:17:43,120
In Jesus' name I pray.

658
01:17:43,120 --> 01:17:44,120
Amen.

659
01:17:44,120 --> 01:17:57,120
I just want to end with a quote that I came across this morning that I think is inspiring for us to leave on.

660
01:17:57,120 --> 01:18:07,580
And he says, I hold a fundamental belief that the greatest gift I've been given, and maybe anyone has been given, to steward on behalf of God and his kingdom is our imagination.

661
01:18:07,580 --> 01:18:17,920
And so I need to treat my imagination like it is a resource for bringing the kingdom of heaven to earth, and it belongs to God.

662
01:18:17,920 --> 01:18:20,700
So we talked a lot about imagination and worship.

663
01:18:21,620 --> 01:18:25,980
And I just pray this week that you think about, what is it that excites your imagination?

664
01:18:25,980 --> 01:18:34,220
And if there, if you've allowed counterfeit kingdom things to be the primary things going around in your imagination,

665
01:18:34,220 --> 01:18:36,700
that that might be something that you and the Lord deal with this week.

666
01:18:36,700 --> 01:18:38,280
Go on, peace, church.

667
01:18:38,280 --> 01:18:38,920
Thank you.

668
01:18:42,920 --> 01:19:12,900
Thank you.

669
01:19:12,920 --> 01:19:19,640
Thank you.
